86
00:05:56,965 --> 00:06:00,854
It keeps three kinds of files out of images:

87
00:06:00,854 --> 00:06:10,134
secrets (.env, keys), junk (logs, .git, editor folders) and things the image builds itself (node_modules,

88
00:06:10,134 --> 00:06:10,753
dist/).

