in .gitignore a pattern without a slash matches at any depth,

107
00:07:15,681 --> 00:07:20,995
but in .dockerignore every pattern is anchored at the root of the context.

108
00:07:20,995 --> 00:07:28,319
.log therefore means ".log files directly in the context root", and logs/debug/app.log does not match.

