00:11:24,283 --> 00:11:30,689
The same code change with Dockerfile.slow, which copies everything before installing.

165
00:11:31,233 --> 00:11:35,525
A one-line code change reinstalled every Python package.

166
00:11:35,525 --> 00:11:40,584
Read the steps top-down and find the first one that is not CACHED:

167
00:11:40,584 --> 00:11:41,504
[3/4] COPY .

168
00:11:41,504 --> 00:11:41,657
..

169
00:11:41,657 --> 00:11:46,256
Its input (the whole folder) changed because app.py changed,

170
00:11:46,256 --> 00:11:51,697
