172
00:11:58,133 --> 00:12:03,364
Order the steps from "changes rarely" to "changes often":

173
00:12:03,364 --> 00:12:09,604
base image, system packages, dependency manifests (requirements.txt,

174
00:12:09,604 --> 00:12:17,220
package*.json, go.mod/go.sum, pom.xml), dependency installation, and the code last.

175
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:19,698
That is exactly Dockerfile.

176
00:12:21,433 --> 00:12:22,147
Got it.

177
00:12:22,147 --> 00:12:24,898
What do I need to remember?

178
00:12:25,433 --> 00:12:31,328
A step is reused when its parent layer, instruction and input files are unchanged.

179
00:12:31,867 --> 00:12:35,546
The first cache miss invalidates every later step.

180
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:40,260
Order Dockerfiles from rarely-changing to often-changing:

181
00:12:40,260 --> 00:12:42,084
dependencies before code.
